   "title": "CHADS2 score",
   "lines": [
    "• Congestive heart failure, Hypertension, Age > 75, Diabetes: 1 each",
    "• prior Stroke or transient ischemic attack: 2",
    "~mitral stenosis is a very high risk too"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "rc_clue_0_0",
   "x": 361,
   "y": 450,
   "w": 276,
